  <Docs>
    <summary>Represents a single option that the user may select using their voice.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents a single option that the user may select using their voice. The getIndex() method should be used as a unique ID to identify the option when it is returned from the voice interactor.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/VoiceInteractor.PickOptionRequest.Option" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.VoiceInteractor.PickOptionRequest.Option</code>.</a></format></para>
